# The application library: well-known services, and what their traffic is.
# Adding one to an exit makes a group of it, which the person can change.
# It is a catalog for anyone, not one person's choices: nothing here goes
# anywhere until it is added to an exit.
#
# One application a line:  <id> | <name> | <icon> | <what it is> | <kind:value ...>
# The kinds are the rules language's: domain: full: keyword: cidr: set:
# process: path:. Values with spaces go in double quotes.
#
# Where SagerNet's sing-geosite has a rule set for the service (the community's
# domain-list-community), the entry carries it: it is the full list, kept
# current. The domains written here are the main ones of that set, so that the
# entry works before the set is fetched, or if it cannot be. Program names and
# paths are not in any set: they are the entry's own.

# ---- AI -------------------------------------------------------------------
claude         | Claude          | sparkles | 网页与桌面 App | domain:anthropic.com domain:claude.ai domain:claude.com domain:clau.de domain:claudeusercontent.com domain:claudemcpclient.com domain:claudemcpcontent.com cidr:160.79.104.0/21 process:Claude process:"Claude Helper" process:"Claude Helper (GPU)" process:"Claude Helper (Renderer)" process:"Claude Helper (Plugin)" set:geosite-anthropic
claude-code    | Claude Code     | terminal | 命令行 | process:claude path:/\.local/share/claude/versions/
chatgpt        | ChatGPT         | sparkles | 网页与桌面 App | domain:openai.com domain:chatgpt.com domain:chat.com domain:sora.com domain:oaistatic.com domain:oaiusercontent.com process:ChatGPT set:geosite-openai
codex          | Codex           | terminal | 命令行 | process:codex
gemini         | Gemini          | sparkles | 网页、AI Studio、NotebookLM | domain:gemini.google.com domain:gemini.google domain:aistudio.google.com domain:ai.studio domain:notebooklm.google.com domain:generativelanguage.googleapis.com domain:deepmind.google domain:deepmind.com set:geosite-google-gemini
grok           | Grok            | sparkles | 网页 | domain:x.ai domain:grok.com domain:grokbot.com set:geosite-xai
perplexity     | Perplexity      | sparkles | 网页与 App | domain:perplexity.ai domain:perplexity.com domain:pplx.ai set:geosite-perplexity
deepseek       | DeepSeek        | sparkles | 网页与 API | domain:deepseek.com domain:deepseeksvc.com set:geosite-deepseek
poe            | Poe             | sparkles | 多模型聊天 | domain:poe.com domain:poecdn.net set:geosite-poe
cursor         | Cursor          | terminal | AI 编辑器 | domain:cursor.com domain:cursor.sh domain:cursorapi.com domain:cursor-cdn.com domain:cursorvm.com set:geosite-cursor
github-copilot | GitHub Copilot  | terminal | 编程助手 | domain:githubcopilot.com full:copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com full:copilot-telemetry-service.githubusercontent.com set:geosite-github-copilot
jetbrains-ai   | JetBrains AI    | terminal | IDE 里的 AI 助手 | domain:jetbrains.ai domain:grazie.ai domain:grazie.aws.intellij.net set:geosite-jetbrains-ai
huggingface    | Hugging Face    | terminal | 模型与数据集 | domain:huggingface.co domain:hf.co domain:hf.space set:geosite-huggingface
ai-abroad      | 海外 AI 合集    | sparkles | 社区维护的海外 AI 服务清单，一次全加 | set:geosite-category-ai-!cn
ip-check       | 出口查询        | globe    | 查看自己出口 IP 的网站 | full:api.ipify.org full:api-ipv4.ip.sb full:v4.ident.me domain:ipinfo.io domain:ip.sb

# ---- Google and the rest of the web ---------------------------------------
google         | Google          | globe    | 搜索、账号与全部 Google 服务 | domain:google.com domain:googleapis.com domain:gstatic.com domain:googleusercontent.com domain:ggpht.com domain:gvt1.com domain:gvt2.com domain:recaptcha.net set:geosite-google
